  VALUES
    ('ios_crash_gate', 'iOS crash gate', 'blocked', 'Authenticated App Store Connect confirms one iOS 1.0.1 crash on 2026-08-25, but privacy suppression exposes no device, OS, crash report, stack, or UUID. Product commit 9c2dce4200dbba5487c8c458ade4616005fde6e6 retains the prior reachable-path and fail-closed hardening and additionally closes three deterministic storage-failure exception escapes in saved-place deletion, unit-preference persistence, and reverse-geocode enrichment. Four throwing-repository regressions, the shared iOS simulator suite, 18 Apple surface XCTest cases, and exact-source app/widget/watch Release simulator builds pass. These preventive results cannot identify or be attributed to the historical event and do not replace its diagnostic and symbolication, exact signed physical iPhone QA, or post-rollout evidence.', 'Obtain any diagnostic report Apple later exposes, symbolicate if available, run exact signed physical iPhone QA, and collect post-rollout evidence'),
    ('open_meteo_promotion_clearance', 'Open-Meteo promotion clearance', 'pass', 'The complete authenticated Gmail record was checked read-only on 2026-08-29. The 06:05:07 +05:00 request described Nimbo as free and non-monetized, with no subscriptions, advertising, paid features, affiliate links, accounts, analytics SDK, or sale of user data, and limited promotion to unpaid localized posts, one personalized contact plus at most one follow-up, genuine Apple/Google editorial submissions, and ordinary unpaid links. At 17:25 +05:00, Nicoletta Addimando via OpenMeteo GmbH replied in ticket 234272 and explicitly confirmed that under those terms Nimbo is entitled to use the non-commercial API. This pass is limited to that exact scope and the published Free API limits; monetization, paid promotion, attribution removal, limit changes, or other material facts require a new licensing decision.', 'Preserve the confirmed scope and reopen licensing review before any material monetization, promotion, attribution, endpoint, or usage-limit change'),
    ('release_artifact_source_sync', 'Release artifact source sync', 'blocked', 'Product commit 9c2dce4200dbba5487c8c458ade4616005fde6e6 resolves to Android phone 1.1.0 (8), Wear OS 1.1.0 (1000008), and Apple 1.1.0 (6). The phone AAB SHA-256 is b7c7acb6e90189e8d73e5b8a5f780bf1d3ab36f43edaf3d5076a1dba4e22d4e5 and mapping SHA-256 is 4fdfeefa05c8f71eb3cc2ac538732672ae2c5ba5793ddd35f03bfa7f6b714d18; the Wear AAB SHA-256 is 2d73fdf1e4fd661a96a699a9fd2ef7b2e989b0f4ab019692ce7c97465673d3fa. Both bundles pass Bundletool 1.18.3 and ZIP integrity, embed the full exact revision, and have zero signature entries. Apple Release simulator hashes are app b7c3ba937658007b07ee9ad8e85ddc892e90f423e7839e0dc112a1070ea04849, widget 7191acd40334d4d9fec6062bc5023450fefbb55006fbd92f57109f41eb27a7ff, and watch c310c785750ffa779e5dfdc30384088fca889deddb11417f2b4e8e0e30109728; UUID-matched dSYMs verify, but the products are ad-hoc simulator outputs. The full Gradle release gate, shared iOS simulator suite, 18 Apple surface tests, and localization parity pass. Exact-current API 24 emulator live/cache/recovery regression evidence passes. Exact-current debug APK and installed bytes SHA-256 52146b883a04e4c2d272ea4e3ecc9b1277a8c78c117b547a121de3a7d90c3730 pass physical API 25 live/tip/offline/recovery/process-health QA and a byte-identical API 36 emulator tablet/widget smoke including Uzbek layout, home widget render/tap, large text, rotation, process health, and cleanup. Android Keychain metadata and the mode-600 keystore are present, but protected signing-value access still fails and was not retried for this build. The API 36 result is emulator debug evidence, and there is no exact-current signed phone/Wear artifact, distribution-signed Apple archive, or signed physical matrix, so the gate remains blocked.', 'Restore private signing authorization without replacing the existing identities, then create exact-current signed phone vc8, Wear 1000008, and Apple build-6 artifacts, verify identities and hashes, and record exact physical QA'),
    ('android_physical_smoke', 'Android device smoke', 'blocked', 'Product commit 9c2dce4200dbba5487c8c458ade4616005fde6e6 exact debug APK and installed bytes SHA-256 52146b883a04e4c2d272ea4e3ecc9b1277a8c78c117b547a121de3a7d90c3730 passed a clean physical General Mobile Android 7.1.1 / API 25 smoke in Russian. Tashkent without location permission, live forecast and truthful late-day Best Time boundary, durable-tip acknowledgement and cold start, cached offline fallback, network recovery, process health, and cleanup passed; the product-scoped fatal/ANR/SSL/CertPath/trust-anchor filter had zero matches. The byte-identical debug APK also passed a fresh no-snapshot Android API 36 Pixel Tablet emulator smoke in Uzbek: landscape onboarding, live forecast, Best Time, durable-tip persistence, home-screen widget discovery/render/tap, font scale 1.3, rotation, process health, and cleanup passed. The exact-source API 24 emulator APK SHA-256 168bb6acdb95453a8dfd141947edbcb9292b756fd3429fffa56fc4baf125dbec retains its live/cache/recovery pass. These are debug regression results; the API 36 tablet/widget result is emulator evidence, not a physical-tablet or upload-signed release result. The current phone and Wear AABs remain unsigned, prior API 37 round-Wear evidence remains historical, and there is no exact-current upload-signed phone rerun, physical tablet/widget result, or paired physical Wear OS result. The gate remains blocked.', 'Sign and verify phone vc8, then run the exact signed artifact on phone and tablet plus widget and paired Wear OS paths'),
    ('ios_physical_smoke', 'iOS physical smoke', 'blocked', 'Product commit 9c2dce4200dbba5487c8c458ade4616005fde6e6 Apple 1.1.0 (6) Release simulator executable hashes are app b7c3ba937658007b07ee9ad8e85ddc892e90f423e7839e0dc112a1070ea04849, widget 7191acd40334d4d9fec6062bc5023450fefbb55006fbd92f57109f41eb27a7ff, and watch c310c785750ffa779e5dfdc30384088fca889deddb11417f2b4e8e0e30109728. UUID-matched dSYMs, the shared iOS simulator suite, 18 Apple surface XCTest cases, the full Gradle release gate, and localization parity pass, but all three products are simulator-only with ad-hoc signatures, no TeamIdentifier, and no upload eligibility. The same exact-current app executable produced twelve EN/RU/UZ iPhone phone sources on an iPhone 17 Pro Max iOS 26.5 simulator at 1320 x 2868, using the checked-in Tashkent quick-city seed, normal live provider, and real 00:00–02:00 Best Time. Four distinct states per locale cover the overview, recent comparison, selected 02:00 timeline, and 10-day/AQI details; exact source identities and SHA-256 values are locked in growth/quality/apple-localized-current-product-capture-2026-08-30.md. A bounded offline attempt did not force the live networking path offline, so its screenshot was rejected and no Apple offline-state capture is claimed. This proves exact-current localized phone screenshot provenance only. Apple Watch capture sources remain historical: RU/UZ are build-5 simulator captures using a retained stale non-PII snapshot, and EN was not recaptured exact-current. There is no exact-current distribution-signed archive, IPA, iOS 15 runtime pass, or physical iPhone/iPad/widget/paired-watch result. Current CoreDevice readiness must be re-established after signing succeeds. The gate remains blocked.', 'Create and verify distribution-signed build 6, re-establish CoreDevice readiness, then run the exact artifact on iPhone, iPad, widget, and paired watch paths'),
    ('domain_activation', 'Domain activation', 'pass', 'At 2026-08-29 10:40–10:41 +05:00, authenticated GitHub Pages settings showed DNS check successful and Enforce HTTPS enabled. The Let''s Encrypt certificate has CN nimbo.uz, SANs nimbo.uz/www.nimbo.uz, and validates for both hosts. WHOIS, .uz delegation, authoritative Cloudflare records, and independent 1.1.1.1/8.8.8.8 resolution pass. HTTPS returns 200 with verification result 0 for all 12 published UZ-root/RU/EN landing, press, privacy, and support routes plus growth, robots, sitemap, and the valid metadata schema. HTTP apex redirects to HTTPS; HTTP www reaches HTTPS apex in two redirects; HTTPS www redirects directly to HTTPS apex. All 12 localized HTML routes have the expected HTTPS canonical and language. Uzbek intentionally uses ' || chr(47) || ' rather than a separate ' || chr(47) || 'uz' || chr(47) || ' route.', 'Maintain dated DNS, certificate, redirect, canonical, and localized-route verification at each release'),
    ('store_policy_console_clearance', 'Store policy console clearance', 'pass', 'The 2026-08-28 App Store read-only check found no open review/compliance action. Google Play reported no policy issues at 2026-08-29 13:12 +05:00; production remained active at 1.0.2 (6), 100%. At 13:59:40 +05:00, UZ Custom Store Listing 4834799756935529888 was saved only as Draft, not submitted for review or published; Publishing overview still showed the latest publication on 2026-08-27. This is point-in-time Console evidence, not a guarantee against later review. See growth/quality/store-policy-console-2026-08-28.md and growth/quality/google-play-console-2026-08-29.md.', 'Re-check both app-global store policy surfaces at the next evidence cutoff')
) AS gates(gate_id, gate, status, evidence, next_action);
